# Martial Fracture: An Interactive Videodisc Case Study for the Social Sciences.

**Authors:** Gerstein, Rosalyn, Sasnett, Russell

## Abstract
Describes an interactive videodisc, Marital Fracture, which portrays a case study of marital separation and is used in mediation training. A software model is highlighted which integrates a relational database of documentary video, audio transcripts, and expert analysis into a multimedia research tool for the humanities and social sciences. (Author/LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ352847

